# Model Name Prefix Response Rules

## Context

- Applies to all user response scenarios
- Enhances user interaction with AI
- Helps users clearly identify which model is responding

## Critical Rules

- Every response must be prefixed with the actual name of the model currently being used
- Format: "[Current Model Name]: [Response Content]"
- Use colon and space to separate model name from response content
- Model name prefix must be included even in brief responses
- Maintain consistent format, do not omit prefix mid-response
- Use the actual model name from the current session, not a fixed specific name
